    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d215">

                <pb facs="1269" n="1111" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg1111"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to Ambassador Thompson</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-12-14"><hi rendition="#italic">December 14,
                        1906</hi>.</date></dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 167.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to the department’s telegram of
                    the 8th instant, regarding the proposed arrangement between the United States
                    and Mexico for the regulation of the transit of merchandise from port to port of
                    either country through the territory of the other, I inclose herewith a copy of
                    a letter from the Acting Secretary of the Treasury expressing his views in the
                    matter.</p>
                <p>It may reasonably be assumed that the intention of the understanding is that each
                    Government shall make known to the other any modifications of the transit
                    regulations which may be made or contemplated, <pb facs="1270" n="1112"
                        xml:id="pg1112"/> thus affording opportunity to make appropriate
                    representations against any change which may be found or deemed burdensome or
                    calculated to impair the principle of reciprocal favor upon which the
                    understanding rests.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Bacon.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d215-a1.xml" xpointer="d215-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
